# .githooks/pre-commit.local -- LOCAL sensitive list for the pre-commit hook.
#
# Copy this file to .githooks/pre-commit.local (gitignored) and fill it in.
# NEVER commit the real file: it names exactly what the policy protects
# (corpus paths, disk letters/labels, handles from the 2000-2002 logs).
#
# Format: one FIXED STRING per line (no regex), matched case-insensitively
# against every added line of the staged diff. Blank lines and lines starting
# with '#' are ignored. Prefer distinctive strings (a full path fragment, a
# rare handle) -- a short common word will block unrelated commits.
#
# Optional: point PRECOMMIT_LOCAL_LIST at one shared file for several repos.
#
# Examples of the *kind* of entry (placeholders, not real values):
#   X:/some/corpus/root
#   corpus-disk-label
#   some_handle_from_the_logs
